{"seq":3,"slug":"continuous-embedding-diffusion","title":"连续嵌入空间扩散","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/architectures/continuous-embedding-diffusion","wordCount":1557,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"连续嵌入空间扩散\">连续嵌入空间扩散</h1><p>D3PM 和 SEDD 都选择正面硬刚文本的离散性，在符号空间里重新发明扩散。还有一条路线选择绕过去：既然连续扩散在图像上如此成熟，那就把离散 token 投影成连续向量，在向量空间做标准高斯扩散，最后再映射回 token。这条路线在 2022 到 2024 年间一度领跑，贡献了 Diffusion-LM、Plaid、Difformer 等代表作，但它撞上了一系列离散扩散没有的独有麻烦——理解这些麻烦，恰好能解释为何规模化的扩散 LLM 最终倒向了掩码扩散。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>连续嵌入扩散的流程是一个「往返」：先用一个嵌入函数把每个 token <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 映射成连续向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EMB</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EMB}(w) \\in \\mathbb{R}^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EMB</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，得到序列的连续表示 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>；然后在这个连续空间上做标准的高斯扩散——前向逐步加高斯噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>α</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>α</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mi>t</mi></msub></mrow></msqrt><mtext> </mtext><mi>ϵ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_t = \\sqrt{\\bar{\\alpha}_t}\\, x_0 + \\sqrt{1-\\bar{\\alpha}_t}\\,\\epsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2461em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7939em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7539em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2461em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.04em;vertical-align:-0.2078em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8322em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.2222em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0037em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7922em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2078em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ϵ</span></span></span></span></span>，反向用神经网络去噪；最后用一个「舍入（rounding）」步骤把去噪得到的连续向量映射回最近的 token。这套前向/反向直接沿用了图像扩散 DDPM 的整套机制（见 <a href=\"../../diffusion-models/foundations/ddpm\">扩散模型基础</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[离散 token w] --&gt;|嵌入 EMB| B[连续向量 x0]&#10;    B --&gt;|高斯前向加噪| C[x_t 含噪向量]&#10;    C --&gt;|神经网络反向去噪| D[预测干净向量 x0_hat]&#10;    D --&gt;|舍入 rounding| E[映射回最近 token]&#10;    F[关键麻烦] --&gt; F1[嵌入坍缩&lt;br/&gt;向量退化到少数点]&#10;    F --&gt; F2[噪声调度失配&lt;br/&gt;小噪声不改变最近 token]&#10;    F --&gt; F3[舍入误差&lt;br/&gt;连续-离散鸿沟]&#10;    F1 -.催生.-&gt; G[anchor loss / 噪声重缩放]&#10;    F2 -.催生.-&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n    A[离散 token w] --&gt;|嵌入 EMB| B[连续向量 x0]\n    B --&gt;|高斯前向加噪| C[x_t 含噪向量]\n    C --&gt;|神经网络反向去噪| D[预测干净向量 x0_hat]\n    D --&gt;|舍入 rounding| E[映射回最近 token]\n    F[关键麻烦] --&gt; F1[嵌入坍缩&lt;br/&gt;向量退化到少数点]\n    F --&gt; F2[噪声调度失配&lt;br/&gt;小噪声不改变最近 token]\n    F --&gt; F3[舍入误差&lt;br/&gt;连续-离散鸿沟]\n    F1 -.催生.-&gt; G[anchor loss / 噪声重缩放]\n    F2 -.催生.-&gt; G</pre><p>下表把嵌入扩散与符号空间扩散（D3PM/SEDD）的根本差异列清：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>连续嵌入扩散</th>\n<th>符号空间扩散（D3PM/SEDD）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>扩散空间</td>\n<td>连续向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">R</mi><mi>d</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{R}^d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>离散符号</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>噪声类型</td>\n<td>高斯</td>\n<td>转移矩阵 / 比值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复用图像扩散工具</td>\n<td>直接复用</td>\n<td>需重建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主要病理</td>\n<td>嵌入坍缩、舍入误差、调度失配</td>\n<td>几乎无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>训练稳定性</td>\n<td>脆弱、需多种修补</td>\n<td>稳健</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>规模化代表</td>\n<td>罕见</td>\n<td>LLaDA、Dream、Mercury</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"三大独有病理\">三大独有病理</h2><p>嵌入扩散的麻烦几乎都源自「连续与离散之间那道没法弥合的缝」。</p>\n<p><strong>嵌入坍缩</strong>是最致命的。嵌入函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>EMB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{EMB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">EMB</span></span></span></span></span></span> 是与扩散网络联合训练的，而模型有一个偷懒的捷径：把所有 token 的嵌入挤到一小撮几乎重合的点上，这样去噪任务变得平凡（反正向量都差不多），损失能降，但生成的文本失去多样性。Difformer（NAACL 2024）专门诊断了这个病理，提出 anchor loss（锚定损失）把嵌入拉开、防止退化。</p>\n<p><strong>噪声调度失配</strong>同样棘手。图像扩散的噪声调度是为「在连续空间平滑地从信号过渡到噪声」设计的，但文本的离散性让小噪声变得无意义——给一个 token 的嵌入向量加一点点高斯噪声，它的最近邻 token 几乎不会改变，也就是说在噪声轨迹的很大一段区间里，「破坏」其实没有真正破坏任何 token。这导致大量训练算力浪费在无效的噪声水平上。Difformer 用噪声重缩放（noise rescaling）来缓解，把有效破坏集中到合适的尺度。</p>\n<p><strong>舍入误差</strong>是收尾环节的鸿沟。反向去噪得到的是一个连续向量，它未必恰好落在任何一个 token 嵌入上，舍入到「最近 token」是个有损操作，去噪越不精确，舍入越容易出错，错一个 token 就可能让整句话跑偏。</p>\n<h2 id=\"历史地位-plaid-与似然里程碑\">历史地位：Plaid 与似然里程碑</h2><p>尽管病理缠身，嵌入扩散在历史上有过高光时刻。Plaid 是第一个被证明在标准语言建模基准上达到与自回归模型可比似然的扩散语言模型——这在当时是个重要的概念验证，说明连续扩散路线至少在原理上能追平自回归的核心指标。Diffusion-LM 则更早地展示了嵌入扩散在可控生成上的潜力：因为在连续空间操作，可以像图像扩散那样用基于梯度的引导（plug-and-play 控制）来约束生成满足语法、长度等属性，这种连续引导是符号空间扩散较难直接做到的，相关能力对比见 <a href=\"../capabilities/controllable-infilling\">可控生成与填空</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为何最终让位于掩码扩散\">为何最终让位于掩码扩散</h2><p>到 2025 年后，规模化的扩散 LLM 几乎清一色选择掩码扩散而非嵌入扩散，原因可以归结为「工程性价比」。其一，掩码扩散始终在离散符号上操作，损失就是熟悉的交叉熵，能直接复用成熟的 Transformer 预训练基建（见 <a href=\"../foundations/masked-denoising-objective\">掩码去噪目标</a>）；嵌入扩散则要额外维护嵌入坍缩、噪声调度、舍入这三套补丁，每一套都引入超参与不稳定。其二，掩码扩散的「[MASK] 位置一目了然」让上下文完全可信，而嵌入扩散里每个位置都是含噪向量，没有干净的锚点。其三，在大词表、大模型上，掩码扩散的稀疏结构与并行解码更容易优化。</p>\n<p>不过嵌入扩散并未消亡，而是退守到「需要连续控制」的细分场景，并在 2025–2026 焕发新的研究兴趣：CoDAR（2026）论证「连续扩散语言模型比想象中更强大」，LaDiR、TextLDM 等把潜在连续扩散用于推理增强（见 <a href=\"../capabilities/reasoning-planning\">推理与规划能力</a>）。可以说，嵌入扩散输掉了「通用语言建模主战场」，却保住了「连续可控与潜在推理」这块自留地。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>连续嵌入扩散把 token 投成向量、在连续空间做标准高斯扩散、再舍入回 token，直接复用图像扩散 DDPM 工具。</li>\n<li>三大独有病理：嵌入坍缩（联合训练偷懒退化）、噪声调度失配（小噪声不改 token）、舍入误差（连续-离散鸿沟）。</li>\n<li>历史地位：Plaid 首次达到与自回归可比似然，Diffusion-LM 展示连续梯度引导的可控生成。</li>\n<li>最终让位于掩码扩散，因后者复用成熟基建、上下文可信、稀疏可规模化；嵌入扩散退守连续控制与潜在推理细分场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>胜出的离散主线：<a href=\"../foundations/masked-denoising-objective\">掩码去噪目标</a></li>\n<li>符号空间扩散对照：<a href=\"d3pm-absorbing-state\">D3PM 与吸收态</a></li>\n<li>连续 vs 离散在可控生成上的差异：<a href=\"../capabilities/controllable-infilling\">可控生成与填空</a></li>\n<li>潜在连续扩散用于推理：<a href=\"../capabilities/reasoning-planning\">推理与规划能力</a></li>\n<li>跨库：高斯前向/反向的母体：<a href=\"../../diffusion-models/foundations/ddpm\">扩散模型基础 DDPM</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"连续嵌入空间扩散","id":"连续嵌入空间扩散"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三大独有病理","id":"三大独有病理"},{"level":2,"text":"历史地位：Plaid 与似然里程碑","id":"历史地位-plaid-与似然里程碑"},{"level":2,"text":"为何最终让位于掩码扩散","id":"为何最终让位于掩码扩散"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"SEDD 与得分熵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/architectures/score-entropy-sedd"},"next":{"title":"并行解码与采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/capabilities/parallel-decoding-sampling"}}